By construction of $M$ and $M_n$ it holds that $\text{(III)}  \lesssim \Vert \operatorname{div} \mathbf{u} - \operatorname{div}_{\boldsymbol{\nu}}^n p_n \mathbf{u} \Vert_{\mathcal{T}_n} \lesssim d_n(\mathbf{u},p_n \mathbf{u})$. 

